"publications"

#: ../../source/use-cases/scientists.rst:40 ce4c81289ac74c9bbacccec349db2df9
msgid ""
"All disciplines — indexes works across the entire scholarly literature, "
"from humanities to medicine."
msgstr ""
"Toutes les disciplines : il indexe les travaux de toute la littérature "
