msgstr "**Scholia**"

#: ../../source/use-cases/scientists.rst:48 813bb08484964990b333ccfdd8cbbfe4
msgid ""
"Wikidata QID for the author, linked publications, co-author graph, "
"employer/affiliation timeline, topical clusters"
msgstr ""
"QID Wikidata de l'auteur, publications associées, graphe de co-auteurs, "
